<p class=\"MsoNormal\">      facets=~g,  alpha=0.1)+</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">        geom_polygon(data=p,fill=&quot;light blue&quot;)</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">pp</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">pp+geom_line(data=n, colour=&quot;red&quot;, size=1, linetype=4)</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Here I am unable to get all the panels on the same row (currently it is a 2X2 layout) and the alpha (transparency) option doesn&#39;t work properly.</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Many Thanks</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">-- <br>\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the ggplot2 mailing list.<br>\nPlease provide a reproducible example: <a href=\"https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792373713565000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1NZQ6RUc4leGUvDL8GWLoF\">\nhttps://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility</a><br>\n <br>\nTo post: email <a rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\nTo unsubscribe: email <a rel=\"nofollow\">ggplot2+u...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\nMore options: <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792373713566000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0hEQJMa8hkTI_yVl71RUmu\">http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</blockquote></div>"
