Normal\">p = data.frame(x=rep(c(1:3,3:1),4), y=rep(c(4:2,3:5),4), g=rep(c(&quot;a&quot;,&quot;b&quot;,&quot;c&quot;,&quot;d&quot;), each=6))<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">p<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">n= data.frame(x=c(1,3,1,2,2,3,1,3), y=c(5,2,3,5,4,2,5,2), g=rep(c(&quot;a&quot;,&quot;b&quot;,&quot;c&quot;,&quot;d&quot;), each=2))<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">n<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><u>Option one :</u></b><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">pp = ggplot() +<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">geom_polygon(data=p, mapping=aes(x=x, y=y),<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">      fill=&quot;light blue&quot;, alpha = 0.5)+ <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">facet_grid(.~g)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">pp<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">But then how do I add those lines from data=n on these polygon plots ?<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><u>Option two :</u></b><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">pp=qplot(data=p,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">      x=x,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<di